        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo Farao akawaita Musa na Haruni na kuwaambia, Mwombeni BWANA, ili awaondoe vyura hawa kwangu mimi na kwa watu wangu; nami nitawapa watu ruhusa waende zao, ili wamtolee BWANA dhabihu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akamwambia Farao, Haya, ujitukuze juu yangu katika jambo hili; sema ni lini unapotaka nikuombee wewe, na watumishi wako, na watu wako, ili hao vyura waangamizwe watoke kwako wewe na nyumba zako, wakae ndani ya mto tu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
