            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akasema, Tazama, mimi natoka kwako, nami nitamwomba BWANA ili hao inzi wamtoke Farao, na watumishi wake, na watu wake kesho; lakini Farao asitende kwa udanganyifu tena, kwa kutowaacha watu waende kumchinjia BWANA dhabihu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
